{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nh9evpd","type":"work","title":"字彙","authors":[{"name":"梅膺祚","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bken"}],"juan_count":{"number":12},"indexed_by":[{"source":"明史藝文志","source_bid":"d59f2mox0000","title_info":"梅膺祚《字彙》十二卷","summary":"梅膺祚《字彙》十二卷"}],"description":{"text":"梅膺祚（明）撰。十二卷。見著錄於《明史藝文志》。其著錄之文，《明史藝文志》作「梅膺祚《字彙》十二卷」。本書惟《明史藝文志》一志著錄，別無他證。《明史藝文志》清張廷玉等修——本書之目賴之以存。","sources":["明史藝文志"]},"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":12}],"measure_info":"十二卷","resources":[{"name":"维基文库","id":"wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%AD%97%E5%BD%99","types":["text"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02076787.cn","types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AD%97%E5%BD%99%28%E4%B8%80%29.djvu"}],"updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:41:40+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"ming","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「明」","dynasty":"明","dynasty_basis":"author_propagation","ai_note":"[ming-round1: author.dynasty 集合=['明'] → dynasty=明]\n\n2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴成，**每節皆據本條 indexed_by 之引文，不出其外，亦不臆造**。凡著錄所無者一字不書。此即 curate-dynasty S3〈借力志書〉之法——本時段有姚振宗《三國藝文志》與丁國鈞《補晉書藝文志》二部斷代志之整理本在庫，其按語備載卷數異同、佚文出處與輯家，正可為佚書之 desc 所本。**未覆核原書**。","revision":"1.0.1","revised_at":"2026-09-07","has_text":true,"has_image":true,"_path":"Work/v/p/d/d59f2nh9evpd-字彙.json","_isDraft":false}